; SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
;
; Waveform streamer for many DMX512 (ANSI E1.11) lines at once.
;
; Every 32-bit FIFO word is one 4 us DMX bit-time. Each bit of the word drives
; one OUT pin (OUT_BASE + n), so a single state machine can drive up to 32
; lines, e.g. 12 transceiver DI pins plus their 12 DE pins. Break, MAB, start
; bits, data and stop bits are all precomputed in the buffer (see
; DmxFrameEncoder), so each line can carry different data, lengths and timing.
;
; Run at 1 MHz with autopull at 32 bits. When the FIFO runs dry the OUT stalls
; and the pins hold the last word, which the encoder always ends with the lines
; idle (mark).

.program DmxStream
.wrap_target
    out pins, 32 [3]   ; 1 + 3 cycles = 4 us per bit-time
.wrap
